    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483950/extras/5f94a7bce871bc779caf796b2c6f40a1.poster.avif?t=1710079068\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483950/extras/5f94a7bce871bc779caf796b2c6f40a1.webm?t=1710079068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483950/extras/5f94a7bce871bc779caf796b2c6f40a1.mp4?t=1710079068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In the abyss, the Diver meets the Kraken! To survive he will have to reach the surface!<br><br>Each card represents a progression stage, from the abyss #0 to the surface #42.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483950/extras/a36e088dd5c9df4d8f79991a6ce43aeb.poster.avif?t=1710079068\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483950/extras/a36e088dd5c9df4d8f79991a6ce43aeb.webm?t=1710079068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483950/extras/a36e088dd5c9df4d8f79991a6ce43aeb.mp4?t=1710079068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Goals:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>  Diver wants to reach the surface, he starts from card #0 and can step up to 3 stages max per turn<br></li><li>  Kraken wants to catch him by guessing all he's played cards. Kraken can guess up to 3 cards per turn.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483950/extras/8adcd3e2406bdba7dfc5b5d929357e9f.poster.avif?t=1710079068\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483950/extras/8adcd3e2406bdba7dfc5b5d929357e9f.webm?t=1710079068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483950/extras/8adcd3e2406bdba7dfc5b5d929357e9f.mp4?t=1710079068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>  Diver can use boosts by sacrificing a card. It can extend step by +2 per sacrificed card! It can be used to play far cards or to trick Kraken!<br></li><li>  Kraken can guess multiple cards each turn, but if one is wrong, guess is failed! It helps to catch Diver faster but might be risky!</li></ul><br>Cards are distributed in three decks according to their value: 1-14, 15-28, 29-41.<br>Pick wisely and you may win the game!<br><br>Under Pressure is and adaptation of Tim Fowers's card game &quot;Fugitive&quot;.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483950/extras/5f94a7bce871bc779caf796b2c6f40a1.poster.avif?t=1710079068\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483950/extras/5f94a7bce871bc779caf796b2c6f40a1.webm?t=1710079068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483950/extras/5f94a7bce871bc779caf796b2c6f40a1.mp4?t=1710079068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>In the abyss, the Diver meets the Kraken! To survive he will have to reach the surface!<br><br>Each card represents a progression stage, from the abyss #0 to the surface #42.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483950/extras/a36e088dd5c9df4d8f79991a6ce43aeb.poster.avif?t=1710079068\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483950/extras/a36e088dd5c9df4d8f79991a6ce43aeb.webm?t=1710079068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483950/extras/a36e088dd5c9df4d8f79991a6ce43aeb.mp4?t=1710079068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Goals:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>  Diver wants to reach the surface, he starts from card #0 and can step up to 3 stages max per turn<br></li><li>  Kraken wants to catch him by guessing all he's played cards. Kraken can guess up to 3 cards per turn.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483950/extras/8adcd3e2406bdba7dfc5b5d929357e9f.poster.avif?t=1710079068\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483950/extras/8adcd3e2406bdba7dfc5b5d929357e9f.webm?t=1710079068\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483950/extras/8adcd3e2406bdba7dfc5b5d929357e9f.mp4?t=1710079068\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>  Diver can use boosts by sacrificing a card. It can extend step by +2 per sacrificed card! It can be used to play far cards or to trick Kraken!<br></li><li>  Kraken can guess multiple cards each turn, but if one is wrong, guess is failed! It helps to catch Diver faster but might be risky!</li></ul><br>Cards are distributed in three decks according to their value: 1-14, 15-28, 29-41.<br>Pick wisely and you may win the game!<br><br>Under Pressure is and adaptation of Tim Fowers's card game &quot;Fugitive&quot;.",
    "short_description": "Flee or hunt? It\u2019s up to you! Under Pressure is an asymmetric card game! To win you will need to strategize and guess.",
